  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"schema-子系统-logger-名稳定","",请求 `schema` 子系统 logger,logger.name MUST 为 `scalim.schema`
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"性能阈值提示包含-performance-前缀","",性能观测检测到 `memory_increase` 超过阈值,"warning message MUST 包含 `[scalim] performance:` 且包含 `memory_increase_mb` 字段"
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"runtime-does-not-log-jsonschema-skip-noise",运行环境未安装 `jsonschema`(或依赖不兼容导致无法导入),用户运行 runtime 入口解析一个在语义校验层面有效的 YAML DSL 配置,输出 MUST NOT 包含任何提示 “已跳过 schema 校验” 或 “jsonschema 不可用” 的 warning message
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"k-v-排序且忽略-none","","需要输出字段 `{b: 2, a: 1, skip: None}`","`k=v` 文本 MUST 为 `a=1, b=2`(顺序稳定)且不包含 `skip`"
  r5,"context-绑定可向下游暴露字段","","系统绑定上下文 `run_id=\"r1\"`",绑定后的 logger MUST 为 `LoggerAdapter` 且其 `extra` MUST 包含 `run_id`
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"print-usage-in-runtime-fails-fast","",在 runtime 代码路径中出现 `print(...)`,"gate MUST fail-fast 并提示迁移到结构化 logger"